    "Principle One states: You Must Treat Your Earning Power as Your Primary Investment Vehicle. Until you are generating at least ten thousand dollars per month in reliable active cash flow, your primary investment dollar must not go into index funds, cryptocurrencies, or private equity; it must be aggressively plowed back into upgrading your skills, your network, and your business infrastructure.",
